---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Head from "../components/Head.astro";
const d = new Date();
const birthday = new Date("2007-01-17");
let age = 0;
if (d.getMonth() >= birthday.getMonth() && d.getDate() >= birthday.getDate()) {
    age = d.getFullYear() - birthday.getFullYear();
} else {
    age = d.getFullYear() - birthday.getFullYear();
}
---
<html>
    <head>
        <Head title="About" author="Clickerty" description="" />
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <div style="z-index: 0; min-height: calc(100vh - 207px); padding: 0 20px;">
            <h1>About</h1>
            <hr>
            <p>
                My name is Clickerty (generally pronounced /ˈklɪkərti/) (real name currently withheld from public view for the sake of my privacy).
                As of 2026, I am an IT and Computer Science student planning to major in Game Development (I know, bad idea, but I'd rather pursue something that fulfills me).</p>
            <p>I was born on the 17th of January, 2007. As of today, I am {age} years old. I was born and raised in Croatia, and my first language is Croatian.</p>
            <p>
                I was raised in a Catholic Christian household to be kind and accepting of others, and to not be overly and uselessly judgmental.
                I am able to discern whether or not something goes against those values, and I'm able to form my own opinions around it.
                I'm accepting of everyone, no matter their physical attributes.
            </p>
            <p>
                I was born male, although I currently identify with the genderfluid/nonbinary label (use any pronouns, I couldn't care less).
                I am also neurodiverse and suffer from ADHD and autism; They negatively affect my quality of life significantly, even though they appear completely invisible.
                There's also some stuff like dysphrasia affecting my ability to speak and construct sentences in speech, but that's not important or severe enough to warrant a mention.
                I'm white, 186cm (6'1") tall and my favorite colors are blue and purple. I wear thick glasses because my vision is actual dogshit—I can't read anything more than ~30cm (~12") away from my face without my glasses.
            </p>
            <p>
                I do a lot of things and have many hobbies, predominantly creative ones. The only ones I'm particularly good at are programming, music production and writing stories.
                I'm amateur at best when it comes to the rest, like art, animation, writing lyrics, singing, playing instruments, writing summaries about who I am as a person, etc.
                There's also a lot of stuff that I want to try doing because I'm sure I'll enjoy it, like learning programs like Blender, improving my singing and doing voice acting,
                improving my art and animation skills, playing all kinds of instruments, learning new languages, etc.
            </p>
            <p>
                Unfortunately, all of the ones I want to try doing I am currently unable to properly do, be it due to expenses (I grew up low middle-class), not having enough time (university takes a LOT of time
                away from you), unfavorable circumstances (I live in an apartment building with paper-thin walls) or just not having enough "dedication" or "discipline" (I am unmedicated and executive dysfunction becomes a bigger problem by the day. Organization is a foreign concept to me).
            </p>
            <p>
                If you're curious as to what kind of art or music I make, then... Well, the music archive is available <a href="/music"><i>here</i></a>, but it's still a work in progress like anything else on this site.
                The art, though, is pretty much unavailable at the moment. Sorry. I'll keep adding stuff.
            </p>
        </div>
        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>
